model_explanation:
Let E0,E1,E2 be expected remaining flips when no match, last flip H, last two HT. Equations:
E0 = 1 + 1/2 E1 + 1/2 E0 → E0 = 2 + E1;
E1 = 1 + 1/2 E1 + 1/2 E2 → E1 = 2 + E2;
E2 = 1 + 1/2·0 + 1/2 E0 → E2 = 1 + 1/2 E0.
Solve: E0 = 4 + E2, so E2 = 1 + 1/2(4+E2) ⇒ E2 = 6, hence E0 = 10. Thus expected number of flips = 10.

